WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:37.105 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM <i>THE EARLY SPRING</i> ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:43.385 --> 01:45.265
-Morning.
-Morning, Mr. Luan.

01:45.345 --> 01:47.425
Can I clean your office now?

01:47.985 --> 01:48.825
Yes.

01:52.705 --> 01:53.905
Shang Zhitao.

01:55.265 --> 01:57.145
Why didn't you send me
the meeting minutes of the business trip?

01:58.265 --> 01:59.465
If you have forgotten about it,

01:59.545 --> 02:01.305
then you can consider resigning today.

02:01.385 --> 02:02.625
I did send it to you.

02:03.225 --> 02:04.665
I finished everything that night,

02:04.745 --> 02:05.945
and I sent it to you and Lumi.

02:06.025 --> 02:07.865
Where did you send it?
I didn't receive anything.

02:07.945 --> 02:09.065
Your e-mail.

02:09.744 --> 02:11.425
I did send it.

02:14.625 --> 02:15.865
There's another Luke in the company.

02:16.625 --> 02:17.865
Are you aware of that?

02:18.985 --> 02:20.665
Luke Liu.

02:21.265 --> 02:22.265
Check your mailbox.

02:22.865 --> 02:24.825
If you sent it to the wrong recipient,
that would be a breach of confidentiality.

02:24.905 --> 02:25.985
That's worse than forgetting to send it.

02:30.265 --> 02:31.265
Now, make sure

02:31.345 --> 02:33.225
to send your resignation letter
to the right address.

02:38.545 --> 02:40.945
Luke Liu?

02:45.025 --> 02:48.625
REPAYING FAVOR WITH YOUR LIFE

02:54.985 --> 02:56.905
-Flora.
-Lumi.

02:56.985 --> 02:58.465
The filming proposal has been approved.

02:58.545 --> 03:00.345
We'll head to the location tomorrow.

03:00.425 --> 03:01.385
But I checked the weather forecast,

03:01.465 --> 03:03.265
and it says there will be
a heavy rainstorm tomorrow.

03:03.905 --> 03:05.265
You know what? In a while,

03:05.345 --> 03:07.185
we'll discuss the filming
contingency plan with Luke.

03:07.265 --> 03:08.185
I…

03:08.265 --> 03:09.825
Can I still join?

03:09.905 --> 03:11.465
Of course.

03:11.545 --> 03:13.105
I've talked to Luke.

03:13.185 --> 03:14.625
You'll come with me.

03:17.505 --> 03:19.105
But I sent the e-mail to the wrong person.

03:19.185 --> 03:21.305
God knows if I can stay here or not.

03:22.185 --> 03:23.185
Listen.

03:23.745 --> 03:26.465
Just do two things well.

03:26.545 --> 03:29.145
Firstly, do what you need to do.

03:29.225 --> 03:30.545
Ace the filming of this commercial.

03:31.145 --> 03:31.985
Secondly,

03:32.785 --> 03:34.865
forget what Luke said.

03:36.305 --> 03:38.385
So I won't be fired?

03:38.465 --> 03:40.305
You won't.

03:40.385 --> 03:42.505
If they fire you,
who is going to work for me?

03:42.585 --> 03:44.905
Besides, we're having
the filming tomorrow.

03:44.985 --> 03:47.225
It's too late to onboard a new person.

03:47.305 --> 03:48.905
Don't worry.

03:48.985 --> 03:51.265
I'll help you stay.

03:52.585 --> 03:54.065
-Thank you, Lumi.
-Sure.

04:04.425 --> 04:05.425
You work at Lime now?

04:07.225 --> 04:08.225
But

04:08.945 --> 04:10.545
I don't know if I'll pass the probation.

04:10.625 --> 04:11.785
Thank you.

04:12.745 --> 04:13.745
Getting into Lime

04:13.825 --> 04:15.505
already gives you bragging rights
at your alma mater.

04:16.504 --> 04:18.145
To survive in Beijing,

04:18.225 --> 04:19.425
you have to go through trial and error.

04:19.944 --> 04:21.785
If you fail, you pay for the lesson.

04:21.865 --> 04:25.185
If you succeed, celebrate it. Drink it.

04:27.225 --> 04:30.225
Oh. How's your boyfriend, Xin Zhaozhou?

04:30.305 --> 04:31.385
Where is he working?

04:34.105 --> 04:37.185
We broke up before graduation.

04:37.905 --> 04:40.465
His mom wanted him
to apply to be a civil servant.

04:40.545 --> 04:44.065
He asked me to move with him,
but I said no.

04:44.145 --> 04:45.665
He could travel.

04:45.745 --> 04:47.425
Why couldn't he move to Beijing?

04:49.225 --> 04:50.985
That's just life, I guess.

04:51.065 --> 04:53.145
He wants to stay in the south.
I want to stay in the north.

04:53.905 --> 04:55.185
We don't have a choice.

04:56.905 --> 04:57.785
It's okay.

04:57.865 --> 05:01.025
Lime has the classiest men
in all of Beijing.

05:01.985 --> 05:03.345
Have a few relationships.

05:03.425 --> 05:05.385
Experience them while you're young.

05:11.865 --> 05:12.865
It's my boss.

05:12.945 --> 05:14.105
I have to take this.

05:17.865 --> 05:19.025
Hi. This is the dessert to go.

05:19.105 --> 05:20.785
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

05:21.505 --> 05:24.105
I knew it. My client suddenly arrived.
I need to head back now.

05:24.865 --> 05:26.825
I packed two portions. Take them with you.

05:26.905 --> 05:27.985
You barely ate.

05:28.865 --> 05:31.225
Keep one for yourself.

05:32.385 --> 05:33.825
I only found out
that you had already footed the bill

05:33.905 --> 05:35.225
when I asked them to pack the food.

05:35.305 --> 05:37.345
But I told you it would be my treat.

05:37.425 --> 05:39.305
Buying me a meal
when you just found a job?

05:39.385 --> 05:40.425
Come on.

05:41.745 --> 05:42.905
Thanks.

05:45.305 --> 05:47.665
You have already outperformed

05:47.745 --> 05:51.105
95% of fresh graduates
by coming to Beijing alone.

05:51.185 --> 05:53.705
Tao, you can do this. Make sure you stay.

05:53.785 --> 05:56.745
When you're inside,
you always stand a chance.

05:57.345 --> 05:58.545
Don't worry.

05:58.625 --> 06:00.265
I will see it through.

06:14.945 --> 06:16.105
Lumi.

06:16.185 --> 06:18.385
Are you okay? Are you unwell?

06:19.505 --> 06:21.665
They can't confirm
the filming site with me.

06:22.305 --> 06:23.625
It's annoying.

06:23.705 --> 06:26.185
Plus, I'm on my period. My tummy hurts.

06:26.265 --> 06:27.345
Come.

06:27.985 --> 06:30.225
Drink this. I brought goji berry brew.

06:30.305 --> 06:32.105
Have some. While it's hot.

06:32.185 --> 06:34.145
When push comes to shove,
we'll stop somewhere.

06:34.225 --> 06:36.105
Take a break. Don't act tough.

06:36.185 --> 06:38.105
It's fine. I can endure this.

06:38.185 --> 06:39.905
We need to set everything up early.

06:39.985 --> 06:41.705
Luke might drop by at night.

06:41.785 --> 06:42.705
He…

06:42.785 --> 06:45.265
He's coming?

06:49.225 --> 06:51.265
Don't be so anxious.

06:51.345 --> 06:53.225
He just has high standards.

06:53.305 --> 06:55.025
He sounds mean, but he isn't.

06:55.105 --> 06:56.185
You'll see why working with him

06:56.265 --> 06:58.465
is a good thing as time goes by.

06:59.265 --> 07:02.585
Luke is not the hypocritical sort.

07:09.425 --> 07:10.265
Thank you.

07:18.385 --> 07:19.225
TAOBAO

07:19.305 --> 07:20.225
Look.

07:30.145 --> 07:31.945
Don't tell me

07:32.025 --> 07:34.425
-you brought your own bedding.
-I did.

07:34.505 --> 07:37.665
I expected a basic living condition,
given that it's a village,

07:37.745 --> 07:39.665
but I didn't expect it to be this bad.

07:40.265 --> 07:41.825
You're provident.

07:41.905 --> 07:43.385
I'm impressed.

07:43.465 --> 07:45.185
You have a bright future ahead of you.

07:45.265 --> 07:47.585
-Can I have this?
-Take it.

07:57.985 --> 07:58.825
Lumi,

07:58.905 --> 08:00.545
I'll check the next village

08:00.625 --> 08:02.545
to see if they have hot water.
I'll bring some to you.

08:02.625 --> 08:04.105
Don't make your bed. Just lie down.

08:04.185 --> 08:05.225
I'll help you later.

08:27.705 --> 08:29.065
Mr. Liu.

08:29.145 --> 08:31.345
Cancel today's itinerary. Just go back.

08:35.865 --> 08:36.904
Lumi.

08:36.985 --> 08:39.425
I got you two bottles of hot water.

08:40.105 --> 08:41.105
I was thinking

08:41.185 --> 08:42.784
I'll prepare cup noodles for you.

08:42.865 --> 08:44.144
Okay? You can eat something.

08:44.225 --> 08:45.585
Are you serious?

08:47.625 --> 08:51.025
I think you just saved my life.

09:05.585 --> 09:06.625
The bag!

09:08.585 --> 09:10.185
<i>Mister. Quick.</i>

09:10.265 --> 09:11.985
<i>To the filming site. Now.</i>

09:16.585 --> 09:18.545
‎-Coming through.
‎-Over here.

09:18.625 --> 09:20.505
We need to confirm the time with him.

09:20.585 --> 09:21.985
It's mainly because of the weather.

09:22.065 --> 09:23.665
I checked the weather forecast.

09:23.745 --> 09:25.785
It says it won't rain,
but it's cloudy now.

09:44.385 --> 09:45.625
We'll start shooting
when the actors are here.

09:45.705 --> 09:47.065
-Okay.
-Lumi.

09:47.145 --> 09:49.025
Tracy sent me over to help out.

09:49.105 --> 09:51.105
I'm Kitty, from Division Three.

09:54.585 --> 09:56.105
Kitty, is it?

09:56.185 --> 09:57.705
The Excel sheet
is in the shared OA system.

09:57.785 --> 09:58.625
-Okay.
-Take a look.

09:58.705 --> 10:00.305
We'll have a meeting
with the director later

10:00.385 --> 10:02.345
-to confirm the plan before we shoot.
-Okay.

10:02.425 --> 10:03.705
This is Shang Zhitao from my division.

10:04.985 --> 10:06.065
Hello.

10:08.785 --> 10:09.745
Still unwell?

10:10.265 --> 10:11.265
Let's go to the hospital.

10:11.345 --> 10:12.825
It's fine. I just need to sit for a while.

10:12.905 --> 10:14.745
Show this to her. Bring her up to date.

10:15.625 --> 10:17.545
Kitty., hold the fort here.

10:17.625 --> 10:19.145
I'll take Lumi back first.

10:19.225 --> 10:20.305
And take a look at this.

10:20.385 --> 10:21.225
-Okay.
-Thank you.

10:22.025 --> 10:23.945
Come. I'm done.

10:24.025 --> 10:25.225
Let's go to the hospital.
Stop acting tough.

10:25.305 --> 10:26.265
-I'm fine.
-Come.

10:26.345 --> 10:27.425
I…

10:27.505 --> 10:28.425
Call me if anything comes up.

10:28.505 --> 10:29.425
Okay.

10:33.865 --> 10:35.865
Did someone corner you at home again?

10:39.785 --> 10:41.265
It must be Zhang Xin.

10:41.345 --> 10:42.505
She came to my shop once.

10:42.585 --> 10:45.105
I said you and I were no longer friends
and asked her to leave.

10:45.745 --> 10:47.585
How does she know where I live?

10:48.265 --> 10:50.185
I'm not surprised.

10:50.265 --> 10:52.545
Women become Sherlock Holmes
when they are obsessed with you.

10:52.625 --> 10:53.825
It's easy to find where you live.

10:54.505 --> 10:56.305
You should head to your parents' mansion

10:56.385 --> 10:58.505
in the suburb and hide there.

10:58.585 --> 10:59.625
We'll see.

10:59.705 --> 11:02.505
I have to head to the filming site
and take a walk there.

11:03.025 --> 11:05.305
-I'll take your car.
-Go ahead. Drive safe.

11:06.745 --> 11:09.305
No wonder you're rich.

11:09.385 --> 11:10.825
You can earn money
while running away from a girl.

11:12.105 --> 11:12.985
Drive safe.

11:14.225 --> 11:16.585
Guys, we have to make it quick today.
Finish it while the sun is up.

11:16.665 --> 11:17.745
It'll rain soon.

11:17.825 --> 11:18.745
Yes, Mr. Director.

11:18.825 --> 11:19.905
Attention!

11:19.985 --> 11:21.265
Wrap it up while the sun is up!

11:21.345 --> 11:22.505
Kitty.

11:22.585 --> 11:24.905
I thought we were supposed
to have the meeting when I came back.

11:24.985 --> 11:26.185
Time is running out.

11:26.265 --> 11:27.545
The director said
it'd rain in the afternoon,

11:27.625 --> 11:29.265
so I had them start earlier.

11:32.225 --> 11:33.305
You must be new.

11:33.385 --> 11:34.505
First time leading a project?

11:35.385 --> 11:36.905
-Yes.
-Oh.

11:37.425 --> 11:38.705
The director said

11:38.785 --> 11:40.145
there are some backup props
we haven't bought.

11:40.225 --> 11:43.305
The driver told me
you had been here before.

11:43.385 --> 11:44.905
I need to make some important calls.

11:44.985 --> 11:48.065
Can I bother you to buy those props?

11:49.625 --> 11:51.745
Sure.

11:51.825 --> 11:53.545
Hold the fort then.

11:53.625 --> 11:55.945
-Keep me updated in the group chat.
-I don't need you to tell me that.

12:00.265 --> 12:05.505
COSTUME DEPARTMENT

12:08.745 --> 12:11.825
<i>Strong precipitation is expected</i>
<i>in the next few hours.</i>

12:11.905 --> 12:13.985
<i>Please take the necessary precautions.</i>

12:17.665 --> 12:18.865
Kitty.

12:18.945 --> 12:20.305
-I bought the props.
-Good.

12:20.385 --> 12:22.185
The actor for the evening scene

12:22.265 --> 12:24.705
complained that our accommodation
was too bad. They refused to come here.

12:25.225 --> 12:27.705
Can you check if there are
better accommodations nearby?

12:28.385 --> 12:30.945
The accommodation is very bad.
I understand why they complain.

12:31.025 --> 12:32.225
Sure.

12:36.425 --> 12:39.105
Mister, how long till we get there?

12:39.185 --> 12:40.865
That village is quite remote.

12:40.945 --> 12:42.225
But worry not,

12:42.305 --> 12:43.625
it's exactly what you're looking for.

12:43.705 --> 12:45.865
If the room is decent,

12:45.945 --> 12:48.625
ask more villagers to spare us some rooms.

12:48.705 --> 12:49.985
With a beautiful lady
like you staying over,

12:50.065 --> 12:53.905
everyone will prepare their beds nicely
and warm them up for you.

13:07.265 --> 13:08.305
‎Hello, Mr. Luan.

13:08.385 --> 13:09.345
Hello, Mr. Luan.

13:11.985 --> 13:12.825
Hello, Mr. Luan.

13:13.345 --> 13:15.065
-Hello, Mr. Luan.
-Hello, Mr. Luan.

13:16.305 --> 13:17.865
Mr. Luan, what brought you here?

13:17.945 --> 13:19.465
Where are Lumi and Shang Zhitao?

13:20.745 --> 13:22.425
Lumi is sick.

13:22.505 --> 13:25.105
Flora went to find new accommodation.
She hasn't returned yet.

13:27.985 --> 13:30.545
The accommodation we found was quite bad.

13:30.625 --> 13:32.145
The actors don't want to stay there,

13:32.225 --> 13:33.665
and their car has broken down.

13:33.745 --> 13:35.105
The other cars
are at the foot of the mountain,

13:35.185 --> 13:38.865
so I asked a villager
to find new accommodation with Flora.

13:38.945 --> 13:40.385
Why didn't you go?

13:41.585 --> 13:42.865
We agreed on the work delegation.

13:42.945 --> 13:44.745
What makes you think
you can delegate work?

14:09.145 --> 14:12.905
<i>Sorry. The user you called</i>
<i>cannot be reached.</i>

14:12.985 --> 14:14.425
<i>Please try again later.</i>

14:18.025 --> 14:19.345
<i>Stop the shoot. Be on standby.</i>

14:19.425 --> 14:20.505
-<i>Call the police. Find her.</i>
-Shang Zhitao!

14:20.585 --> 14:21.545
Shang Zhitao!

14:22.625 --> 14:24.025
<i>The girl looking for rooms</i>
<i>went to the mountain.</i>

14:24.105 --> 14:26.425
<i>The back mountain is full of steep slopes.</i>
<i>It might collapse anytime.</i>

14:26.505 --> 14:27.905
<i>There could also be rockfalls.</i>

14:27.985 --> 14:29.265
<i>You'll die if you go in.</i>

14:31.625 --> 14:32.945
It's just right in front.

14:33.025 --> 14:35.385
Once we're in the village,
we'll find a shelter first.

14:35.465 --> 14:37.105
Once the rain stops,
I'll ride back with you.

14:44.185 --> 14:46.225
Mister. The rain is too heavy.

14:46.305 --> 14:48.105
Let's turn back. Just forget it.

14:48.185 --> 14:49.705
I have not seen this road before.

14:49.785 --> 14:51.625
This isn't how we came here.

14:51.705 --> 14:54.225
It's raining. This is a shortcut.

14:55.745 --> 14:57.145
The road condition is awful.

14:57.225 --> 14:58.585
Just cling to me.

14:59.105 --> 15:00.625
-Come. Come.
-Hey, you…

15:01.185 --> 15:02.385
Come.

16:41.145 --> 16:42.745
LANDSLIDE WARNING, NO ENTRY

18:39.985 --> 18:40.865
Luan Nian!

18:42.825 --> 18:43.825
Luan Nian!

18:49.465 --> 18:50.305
Luan Nian!

18:51.945 --> 18:53.905
Luan Nian! Luan Nian!

18:58.665 --> 18:59.545
It's dangerous here.

18:59.625 --> 19:00.785
Find a safe place first.

19:08.585 --> 19:09.705
Forget about me. Go now.

19:14.105 --> 19:15.065
Go now!

19:31.505 --> 19:32.385
Shang Zhitao.

19:57.905 --> 19:58.745
Are you okay?

20:00.225 --> 20:01.345
I just sprained my ankle.

20:01.425 --> 20:02.985
It hurts when I move.

20:08.185 --> 20:09.145
Your hand is bleeding.

20:13.905 --> 20:14.985
Hang in there.

20:15.745 --> 20:17.225
We should get out as soon as possible.

20:17.305 --> 20:18.425
There might be landslides.

20:25.465 --> 20:26.585
Put these on.

20:49.145 --> 20:50.225
Did I do it right?

20:51.185 --> 20:52.625
There are falling rocks.

20:55.345 --> 20:56.665
We have to take another route.

21:13.425 --> 21:15.665
Listen to my command later.
Do not thrash around.

21:16.905 --> 21:19.185
No matter what happens, do not let go.

21:41.305 --> 21:42.305
Hug me tightly.

22:06.985 --> 22:07.905
Slowly.

22:09.385 --> 22:10.625
Let's rest here.

22:12.985 --> 22:13.945
Are we safe now?

22:15.065 --> 22:16.025
For now, yes.

22:16.105 --> 22:19.265
There should be a village right in front.

22:25.665 --> 22:26.705
Sit down.

22:32.945 --> 22:33.945
How come you came?

22:37.465 --> 22:39.425
Venturing alone in this remote place?

22:40.345 --> 22:42.465
Must a rookie like you work
this hard even in this dire situation?

22:44.065 --> 22:45.865
No one could reach you,
so everyone came to find you.

22:47.505 --> 22:49.145
Fortunately, you are fine.

22:50.105 --> 22:50.945
Put this on.

23:00.145 --> 23:02.745
Sorry. I've troubled
the company once again.

23:14.585 --> 23:16.785
It might hurt a little. Bear with me.

23:43.145 --> 23:44.025
Thank you.

24:01.665 --> 24:03.825
Don't move. I'm more cautious
than you are.

24:03.905 --> 24:05.345
If you become a cripple,

24:05.865 --> 24:07.545
you can always come to work
in your wheelchair.

24:25.625 --> 24:27.025
You're injured.

24:27.105 --> 24:28.665
It's quite serious.

24:28.745 --> 24:29.585
I'm fine.

24:35.585 --> 24:37.665
We're in the same boat.

24:38.345 --> 24:39.345
Let me dress the wound for you.

24:56.065 --> 24:56.905
Sorry.

24:58.265 --> 24:59.105
I'm fine.

25:11.065 --> 25:11.905
Does it hurt?

26:00.065 --> 26:01.145
Get up.

26:10.745 --> 26:11.585
Take this.

26:17.185 --> 26:18.385
Come.

26:38.145 --> 26:41.665
When I was stuck inside,

26:41.745 --> 26:42.825
I felt hopeless.

26:43.385 --> 26:44.745
I thought

26:46.345 --> 26:50.105
that for my first project in Lime,
I would be on the social news.

26:52.185 --> 26:53.185
In my projects,

26:54.025 --> 26:55.865
only my client's ads
get to be on the news.

26:56.745 --> 26:57.665
Not my subordinates.

26:59.865 --> 27:01.145
I was also thinking

27:02.905 --> 27:07.065
that I would die, but I hadn't left
any last words for my parents.

27:09.585 --> 27:10.625
What would you have said?

27:12.025 --> 27:13.705
I…

27:13.785 --> 27:16.025
I would never have the chance
to repay their kindness.

27:16.105 --> 27:17.545
And back then, I was craving

27:17.625 --> 27:19.785
my dad's braised fish.

27:22.705 --> 27:24.705
You barely escaped,

27:24.785 --> 27:26.305
and you now want to kill a fish?

27:26.385 --> 27:27.865
But didn't they say

27:28.545 --> 27:30.305
eating fish makes you smarter?

27:30.385 --> 27:32.945
I want to be smart and stay at Lime

27:33.025 --> 27:34.185
to learn from you.

27:38.625 --> 27:39.945
How did you know

27:40.465 --> 27:41.905
to hit the corner
of the window to smash it open?

27:42.625 --> 27:45.745
I saw it on the news.
I didn't know it'd work.

27:48.185 --> 27:51.385
It seems like your brain
isn't as empty as I thought.

28:06.945 --> 28:08.545
‎-There they are.
‎-Over there.

28:08.625 --> 28:09.985
Luke! Shang Zhitao.

28:10.065 --> 28:11.585
They are there. We found them.

28:11.665 --> 28:12.625
-Over there!
-It's them!

28:12.705 --> 28:14.385
-That's them.
-Looks like they're hurt.

28:14.465 --> 28:15.305
‎Call 120.

28:15.385 --> 28:16.225
‎Get them to a hospital.

28:39.305 --> 28:43.065
HEALTH FIRST, EXPERT CARE

29:43.265 --> 29:44.105
Nurse,

29:44.945 --> 29:46.385
where is the guy on the bed?

29:46.465 --> 29:47.945
Passed out
due to an intracranial hemorrhage.

29:48.025 --> 29:49.145
He was just sent to a major hospital
for emergency treatment.

29:51.985 --> 29:52.825
He…

29:53.465 --> 29:55.665
But he was fine last night.

29:55.745 --> 29:56.865
Most acute damage only appears

29:56.945 --> 29:58.945
several hours
after the wound is inflicted.

29:59.025 --> 30:01.305
You won't notice it at the time,
and when you do, it's too late.

30:02.505 --> 30:04.025
Where is he? I have to find him.

30:04.105 --> 30:05.145
Wait.

30:06.025 --> 30:07.225
What's the hurry?

30:09.465 --> 30:11.945
Aren't you the one
being rushed to emergency?

30:13.305 --> 30:14.425
Can you not jinx me?

30:15.105 --> 30:15.985
It's the other patient.

30:21.825 --> 30:23.025
The filming is over.

30:23.545 --> 30:24.785
I'll send you back to Beijing later.

30:25.385 --> 30:26.665
I hope I didn't cause any delays.

30:27.665 --> 30:30.385
Now is not the time for this.

30:42.385 --> 30:43.345
Eat now.

31:00.065 --> 31:02.545
Flora. Let's reflect on your work.

31:03.265 --> 31:06.265
Do you think you handled
this project well?

31:07.385 --> 31:09.345
I shouldn't have acted on my own.

31:09.865 --> 31:11.385
I lacked danger awareness.

31:12.465 --> 31:13.865
I caused trouble for everyone.

31:15.505 --> 31:16.705
What about teamwork?

31:18.185 --> 31:19.025
It was good.

31:21.865 --> 31:23.585
You still haven't realized
the problem, have you?

31:24.665 --> 31:25.985
Is Kitty your boss?

31:27.945 --> 31:29.665
Lumi and you are my bosses.

31:29.745 --> 31:31.625
Kitty is just a senior.

31:33.705 --> 31:34.745
A senior.

31:35.585 --> 31:37.225
There are many seniors in the office.

31:37.745 --> 31:41.265
Can a senior staff member
boss you around in your project?

31:41.865 --> 31:43.825
What's the point
of your project lead then?

31:47.865 --> 31:50.585
Are you going to ask me
to resign again this time?

32:01.105 --> 32:03.105
Rest up. Take care of yourself.

32:03.785 --> 32:04.745
Make sure to go through
with the follow-up examination.

32:06.025 --> 32:08.145
If you feel unwell, go to Lumi

32:09.185 --> 32:10.105
or me.

32:14.145 --> 32:15.665
Thank you for the advice, Luke.

32:16.265 --> 32:17.905
I will follow your advice from now on.

32:45.025 --> 32:47.145
What kind of job is this?

32:47.225 --> 32:48.945
You are a cripple now.

32:49.505 --> 32:50.665
Come. Let me do it.

32:50.745 --> 32:52.185
Stop. Let me do it.

32:52.985 --> 32:54.465
Knowing your situation,

32:55.265 --> 32:57.385
you'll probably have to rest
at home for six months. Come.

32:58.505 --> 33:00.185
Make the company
support you for ten years.

33:00.945 --> 33:02.665
The doctor said

33:02.745 --> 33:04.785
-my bone wasn't affected.
-Careful.

33:04.865 --> 33:08.145
Besides, Luan Nian got injured
while rescuing me as well.

33:08.825 --> 33:11.065
Now is not the time to be selfless.

33:12.425 --> 33:13.705
They are two different things.

33:13.785 --> 33:15.385
You got injured during work,

33:15.465 --> 33:16.305
so the company
must take full responsibility.

33:23.265 --> 33:25.025
As for Luan Nian…

33:25.105 --> 33:26.505
For saving your life,

33:27.105 --> 33:28.225
devote yourself to him.

33:28.745 --> 33:29.625
Then, you're even.

33:29.705 --> 33:31.905
-How sweet.
-Your job habit is coming out.

33:34.225 --> 33:35.185
No.

33:35.825 --> 33:37.985
He is a bad person.

33:38.065 --> 33:39.745
He gave you a hard time.

33:39.825 --> 33:40.825
He asked you to resign.

33:40.905 --> 33:41.865
That's workplace bullying.

33:41.945 --> 33:43.665
No. He's a bad person.

33:43.745 --> 33:45.465
How can our Tao fall for him?

33:45.545 --> 33:46.825
No. Not at all.

33:46.905 --> 33:48.065
You misunderstood.

33:48.145 --> 33:49.705
He is

33:50.305 --> 33:52.585
cold-faced and sharp-tongued,
but kind on the inside.

33:52.665 --> 33:55.625
Look. He cares
about his subordinates' safety.

33:56.665 --> 33:58.545
And he teaches me many things.

33:58.625 --> 34:01.065
I think I might have
misjudged him previously.

34:01.145 --> 34:02.545
-He…
-Shang Zhitao.

34:03.545 --> 34:05.265
Did you notice that?

34:07.745 --> 34:08.824
I…

34:08.905 --> 34:09.985
Notice what?

34:10.065 --> 34:13.065
You're defending him.

34:13.865 --> 34:15.425
You're praising him.

34:22.545 --> 34:24.985
I'm just being objective, okay?

34:26.225 --> 34:27.264
Objective, right.

34:27.865 --> 34:30.025
He came to my rescue alone.

34:30.545 --> 34:32.065
Anyone would be moved by that.

34:32.145 --> 34:33.784
Yes, he came to your rescue alone.

34:33.865 --> 34:35.225
You two saved each other.

34:35.304 --> 34:36.985
I am so moved by it.

34:38.185 --> 34:39.185
Shang Zhitao.

34:39.945 --> 34:41.585
Listen.

34:41.665 --> 34:44.025
Be brave when you have to.

34:44.105 --> 34:47.225
Don't miss out on the perfect guy
you ran into with your life.

34:54.225 --> 34:55.705
Why isn't Zhu back yet?

34:55.784 --> 34:58.025
Didn't he mention
he'd make pork rib soup today?

34:58.105 --> 35:00.625
Oh, my mom even bought
the Harbin red sausages

35:00.705 --> 35:02.345
that you like.

35:02.425 --> 35:03.425
-Changing the topic?
-We…

35:03.505 --> 35:04.865
Okay. I get it.

35:04.945 --> 35:06.305
Let me call Zhu now

35:06.385 --> 35:07.825
so that he'll come back
to boil the pork rib soup

35:07.905 --> 35:08.945
and give you the nutrients you need.

35:27.785 --> 35:29.025
Anything you want to add?

35:29.105 --> 35:30.025
-That's all.
-Nothing.

35:30.105 --> 35:32.025
-That's all.
-Sign the contract then.

35:32.545 --> 35:34.185
-Okay.
-That's all.

35:34.265 --> 35:35.105
Dismissed.

35:36.825 --> 35:38.185
I'm heading to Finance.

36:06.505 --> 36:07.745
Colin, bring my laptop over.

36:07.825 --> 36:09.025
Luan Nian.

36:11.025 --> 36:13.985
I heard someone
almost died in your project.

36:14.505 --> 36:15.425
That is scary.

36:16.225 --> 36:18.345
I hope the client
didn't give you a hard time.

36:18.425 --> 36:20.265
Projects always come with risks.

36:21.025 --> 36:22.825
After all, not everyone can rely on luck

36:22.905 --> 36:26.065
and copy someone else's idea as you do.

36:26.145 --> 36:29.145
Ideas are meant to bounce off each other.

36:30.065 --> 36:31.425
The difference
between inspiration and plagiarism

36:31.505 --> 36:34.345
is similar to the difference
between a professional and you.

36:35.185 --> 36:36.385
How is it?

36:36.465 --> 36:38.585
Did you enjoy cleaning up the huge mess
you snatched from me?

36:39.265 --> 36:41.585
That's one of Lime's biggest clients.

36:42.905 --> 36:44.345
Of course, it is.

36:44.425 --> 36:46.105
But somehow, when you manage it,

36:46.625 --> 36:48.705
half of the client's budget is axed,

36:48.785 --> 36:50.585
and you had to work overtime
to fix the presentation deck.

36:51.345 --> 36:52.465
How's your sleep?

36:52.545 --> 36:54.025
Your eye bags
are about to fall on the floor.

36:57.905 --> 36:59.545
Don't you have work to do?

37:09.985 --> 37:10.825
Flora.

37:11.345 --> 37:12.345
Lumi.

37:12.425 --> 37:13.985
Why did you come to work?

37:14.065 --> 37:15.505
You can barely walk.

37:15.585 --> 37:16.665
It's fine. I went to get
my follow-up examination.

37:16.745 --> 37:18.305
The doctor said
I just needed to rest for two days.

37:18.385 --> 37:19.265
I forgot to take my laptop,

37:19.345 --> 37:21.145
so I came to check on everything.

37:21.825 --> 37:23.705
This is a work injury.

37:24.585 --> 37:26.385
Lime will not exploit you.

37:26.465 --> 37:28.025
They even bought insurance for you.

37:28.105 --> 37:30.145
Just stay at home and rest up.

37:30.865 --> 37:31.865
Go back.

37:33.345 --> 37:37.145
Actually, I want to thank Luke.

37:38.225 --> 37:39.465
Of course.

37:39.545 --> 37:41.305
But don't buy him any gifts.

37:41.385 --> 37:43.065
You can buy him a meal.

37:44.225 --> 37:45.065
I'll think about it.

37:45.145 --> 37:46.425
Yes!

37:46.505 --> 37:47.825
A new record.

37:47.905 --> 37:49.665
We got it. We are just too amazing.

37:50.745 --> 37:52.025
What a stellar result.

38:05.985 --> 38:07.905
I need to share something with you.

38:08.945 --> 38:09.865
I just got news

38:09.945 --> 38:13.745
that our team
secured the Mulanshuo project

38:13.825 --> 38:15.345
for annual advertising.

38:20.945 --> 38:23.985
Thank you for your hard work
the past three months.

38:24.505 --> 38:28.065
But as usual, we'll celebrate later.

38:28.665 --> 38:30.385
We still have work to finish.

38:30.465 --> 38:32.785
Make sure the online operations
go smoothly this week.

38:33.385 --> 38:37.385
We'll gather here every morning
at 8:00 a.m. for a daily briefing report.

38:37.465 --> 38:39.225
-Okay?
-Sure.

38:41.065 --> 38:42.225
‎Give it a quick touch-up.

38:46.385 --> 38:49.065
While everyone's here today,
let's have a recap of the project.

38:50.985 --> 38:52.905
As you all know,
a major incident took place

38:53.865 --> 38:54.905
during the day of filming.

38:57.825 --> 38:58.705
Mr. Luan,

38:58.785 --> 39:01.865
I meant to find
an opportunity to explain to you.

39:01.945 --> 39:03.345
I wasn't shirking my duty that day.

39:03.425 --> 39:05.025
The script was changed last minute,

39:05.105 --> 39:07.105
so I needed
to discuss it with the director.

39:07.185 --> 39:09.265
I was busy, so I asked Flora to help me.

39:10.065 --> 39:12.185
I'll make sure
to keep this in mind moving forward.

39:12.985 --> 39:14.865
So what's the point
of sending you over to assist?

39:15.465 --> 39:16.305
I…

39:16.985 --> 39:19.985
I didn't know Shang Zhitao was new here.

39:20.065 --> 39:21.745
I thought she could handle it.

39:21.825 --> 39:24.545
And everyone said
that she knew that place very well,

39:24.625 --> 39:25.865
so I let her handle it.

39:26.585 --> 39:27.705
Who is everyone?

39:32.705 --> 39:35.745
My management style is quite simple.
Regardless of your experience,

39:35.825 --> 39:37.945
those who won't take responsibility
will be replaced

39:38.025 --> 39:39.905
by those who will.

39:41.905 --> 39:43.705
Flora is new.

39:43.785 --> 39:45.505
She wanted to prove herself

39:45.585 --> 39:46.425
and was eager to take on tasks.

39:46.505 --> 39:47.665
-I can't stop her.
-Kitty.

39:48.905 --> 39:51.265
You have not been promoted
for three years.

39:51.345 --> 39:53.585
I understand that you see
the new hire as a threat,

39:54.585 --> 39:56.665
but that doesn't mean you should lie.

39:57.185 --> 40:01.145
Shang Zhitao invited the director
over from Guangzhou herself.

40:01.665 --> 40:04.825
What do you mean she needed you
to manage the director?

40:08.945 --> 40:10.225
What's done is done.

40:10.305 --> 40:12.065
Now, we need to solve the problem.

40:12.945 --> 40:14.065
This time, everyone
on the management level,

40:14.145 --> 40:15.385
including me, has to take accountability.

40:15.465 --> 40:17.345
One, it was our oversight.

40:17.425 --> 40:18.305
Two,

40:19.545 --> 40:21.265
we did not train
our new employee adequately.

40:22.425 --> 40:25.505
Lime will punish all relevant personnel,

40:25.585 --> 40:26.985
including me.

40:38.785 --> 40:42.105
Lumi's report yesterday
mentioned Flora specifically.

40:42.745 --> 40:44.625
I plan to confirm her position.

40:44.705 --> 40:46.065
Are you okay with it?

40:46.145 --> 40:48.585
<i>You have the final say.</i>
<i>I can never say no.</i>

40:49.985 --> 40:52.225
And I thought you finally
acknowledged her capabilities

40:52.305 --> 40:53.945
and my taste.

40:54.705 --> 40:57.305
<i>You sure have a peculiar taste.</i>

40:58.465 --> 41:00.905
So, I'll proceed then.

41:04.585 --> 41:05.625
Look at this.

41:09.185 --> 41:11.145
LIME ADVERTISING EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT

41:11.225 --> 41:13.065
EMPLOYEE: SHANG ZHITAO

41:13.665 --> 41:15.305
Employment contract?

41:15.865 --> 41:18.945
Your performance
in your first position was impressive.

41:19.025 --> 41:20.385
I have talked to Luke.

41:20.465 --> 41:22.985
He agreed to let you stay
at Business Division One.

41:23.065 --> 41:24.265
Do you want the position?

41:26.305 --> 41:27.425
Yes.

41:28.025 --> 41:29.025
Then, sign the contract.

41:30.345 --> 41:31.465
Thank you, Tracy.

41:31.545 --> 41:32.505
No need to thank me.

41:32.585 --> 41:35.785
Everyone saw how diligent
and responsible you are.

41:36.305 --> 41:38.305
You earned the contract yourself.

41:38.385 --> 41:39.465
Keep it up.

41:40.225 --> 41:42.385
I… I'll continue to work hard.

41:43.065 --> 41:46.545
Beijing is harsh but fair.

41:46.625 --> 41:48.225
But in Lime,

41:48.305 --> 41:50.545
if you work hard,
you will get something back.

42:06.505 --> 42:08.665
<i>Do you have time?</i>

42:08.745 --> 42:12.185
<i>I would like</i>
<i>to buy you a meal to thank you.</i>

42:15.785 --> 42:16.625
<i>No need.</i>

42:24.265 --> 42:26.465
<i>I'll buy you a meal tonight.</i>
<i>Send me the address.</i>

42:27.065 --> 42:28.065
<i>I'll pick you up.</i>

43:32.665 --> 43:33.705
Hug me tighter.

43:44.345 --> 43:45.265
Careful.
